one ownership kind. `USER` returns only the root domains this caller defined; `PLATFORM` returns only the tenant-level `app.<suffix>` zones the deployment provisions for app publishing. Omitted means both kinds, which is the audit view.","in":"query","name":"scope","schema":{"enum":["USER","PLATFORM"],"type":"string"}},{"description":"Restrict the inventory to the zones pinned to one cloud account. Omitted filters nothing. The literal `UNASSIGNED` selects the zones pinned to no account — the ones whose account resolves per operation. The literal cannot collide with a real account id, because the id shape admits only ASCII alphanumerics and `_.:-` after a leading alphanumeric. A facet, not a grant: it can only narrow the zones the owner gate already allows the caller to reach.","in":"query","name":"provider_account_id","schema":{"maxLength":128,"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SdkWorkApiResponse"},{"properties":{"data":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"items":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainZoneResponse"},"type":"array"},"pageInfo":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PageInfo"}},"required":["items","pageInfo"],"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}]}}},"description":"Success"},"401":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"未认证"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"List root domain zones","tags":["domain"]},"post":{"operationId":"domainZones.create","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKeyParam"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CreateDomainZoneRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SdkWorkApiResponse"},{"properties":{"data":{"properties":{"item":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainZoneResponse"}},"required":["item"],"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}]}}},"description":"Created"},"409":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源冲突"},"422":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"校验错误"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"Define a root domain zone","tags":["domain"],"x-sdkwork-idempotent":true}},"/app/v3/api/domain_zones/{zoneId}":{"delete":{"operationId":"domainZones.delete","parameters":[],"responses":{"204":{"description":"Deleted"},"404":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源不存在"},"409":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源冲突"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"Delete an empty root domain zone","tags":["domain"]},"get":{"operationId":"domainZones.retrieve","parameters":[],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SdkWorkApiResponse"},{"properties":{"data":{"properties":{"item":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainZoneResponse"}},"required":["item"],"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}]}}},"description":"Success"},"404":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源不存在"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"Retrieve a root domain zone","tags":["domain"]},"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DomainZoneIdParam"}],"patch":{"operationId":"domainZones.update","parameters":[],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UpdateDomainZoneRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SdkWorkApiResponse"},{"properties":{"data":{"properties":{"item":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainZoneResponse"}},"required":["item"],"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}]}}},"description":"Updated"},"404":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源不存在"},"422":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"校验错误"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"Update a root domain zone","tags":["domain"]}},"/app/v3/api/domain_zones/{zoneId}/dns_records":{"get":{"description":"Pages the resolution-record snapshot the last cloud-account sync read from the provider: record type and record content (the resolution IP for A/AAAA, the target for CNAME/MX) per owner. The read never contacts the provider — `domainZones.dnsRecords.sync` does that. A record whose owner matches no registered hostname still shows here at Zone scope; a record matched to a hostname deleted after the sync does not.","operationId":"domainZones.dnsRecords.list","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/PageParam"},{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/PageSizeParam"},{"description":"Restrict the page to one registered hostname by id. The sync has already applied the wildcard semantics when it stamped each record with its hostname — a wildcard declaration's rows are its star record, its base owner and every owner exactly one label beneath it — so the filter is one equality, not a name match.","in":"query","name":"hostname_id","schema":{"format":"uuid","type":"string"}},{"description":"Restrict the page to records whose 主机记录 (zone-relative owner) contains this keyword, case-insensitive.","in":"query","name":"host","schema":{"maxLength":253,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},{"description":"Restrict the page to one record type (exact spelling, e.g. `A`).","in":"query","name":"record_type","schema":{"enum":["A","AAAA","CNAME","TXT","MX","NS","CAA"],"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SdkWorkApiResponse"},{"properties":{"data":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"items":{"items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainDnsRecordResponse"},"type":"array"},"pageInfo":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/PageInfo"}},"required":["items","pageInfo"],"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}]}}},"description":"Zone resolution records returned successfully."},"404":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源不存在"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"List a Zone's synced DNS resolution records","tags":["domain"]},"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DomainZoneIdParam"}],"post":{"description":"Validates the change (type in the managed set, owner in the DNS label alphabet, value parsed per type) and writes it through the Zone's cloud account, then joins the vendor's answer to the stored snapshot. The owner is the zone-relative 主机记录 (`@`, `www`, `*`); an owner already carrying the zone suffix is refused before the vendor is asked.","operationId":"domainZones.dnsRecords.create","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKeyParam"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CreateDomainDnsRecordRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"201":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SdkWorkApiResponse"},{"properties":{"data":{"properties":{"item":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainDnsRecordResponse"}},"required":["item"],"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}]}}},"description":"Resolution record created successfully."},"404":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源不存在"},"422":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"校验错误"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"Create a resolution record through the Zone's cloud account","tags":["domain"],"x-sdkwork-idempotent":true}},"/app/v3/api/domain_zones/{zoneId}/dns_records/sync":{"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DomainZoneIdParam"}],"post":{"description":"Re-reads the Zone's record inventory from its DNS provider through the same presenter chain certificate issuance uses — the Zone's pinned account, then the account center's choice for the declared provider, then the deployment-level configuration — and replaces the stored snapshot whole. Two syncs in a row answer with equivalent snapshots, so the operation is idempotent.","operationId":"domainZones.dnsRecords.sync","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKeyParam"}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SdkWorkApiResponse"},{"properties":{"data":{"properties":{"item":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainDnsSyncResponse"}},"required":["item"],"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}]}}},"description":"Resolution records synced successfully."},"404":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源不存在"},"422":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"校验错误"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"Sync a Zone's resolution records through its cloud account","tags":["domain"],"x-sdkwork-idempotent":true}},"/app/v3/api/domain_zones/{zoneId}/dns_records/{recordId}":{"delete":{"description":"Deletes on the provider first and removes the stored row second, so a failed vendor delete never leaves a page serving a name the zone does not answer.","operationId":"domainZones.dnsRecords.delete","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKeyParam"}],"responses":{"204":{"description":"Resolution record deleted successfully."},"404":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源不存在"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"Delete a resolution record through the Zone's cloud account","tags":["domain"],"x-sdkwork-idempotent":true},"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DomainZoneIdParam"},{"in":"path","name":"recordId","required":true,"schema":{"format":"uuid","type":"string"}}],"patch":{"description":"A full replace of owner/type/value/TTL — the update shape every integrated vendor shares — followed by the same replace in the stored snapshot. The provider-side pause state is not touched here; only the status operation flips it.","operationId":"domainZones.dnsRecords.update","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKeyParam"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/UpdateDomainDnsRecordRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SdkWorkApiResponse"},{"properties":{"data":{"properties":{"item":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainDnsRecordResponse"}},"required":["item"],"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}]}}},"description":"Resolution record updated successfully."},"404":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源不存在"},"422":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"校验错误"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"Replace a resolution record in place through the Zone's cloud account","tags":["domain"],"x-sdkwork-idempotent":true}},"/app/v3/api/domain_zones/{zoneId}/dns_records/{recordId}/status":{"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DomainZoneIdParam"},{"in":"path","name":"recordId","required":true,"schema":{"format":"uuid","type":"string"}}],"patch":{"description":"The provider is flipped first and the stored row second, so a failed vendor call never leaves the page claiming a state the vendor did not accept. A vendor without a per-record pause (Cloudflare) answers its own refusal.","operationId":"domainZones.dnsRecords.status.update","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKeyParam"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainDnsRecordStatusRequest"}}},"required":true},"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SdkWorkApiResponse"},{"properties":{"data":{"properties":{"item":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/DomainDnsRecordResponse"}},"required":["item"],"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}]}}},"description":"Resolution record status updated successfully."},"404":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"资源不存在"},"422":{"content":{"application/problem+json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ProblemDetail"}}},"description":"校验错误"}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"Pause a resolution record or resume it","tags":["domain"],"x-sdkwork-idempotent":true}},"/app/v3/api/domain_zones/{zoneId}/hostname_claims":{"parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/DomainZoneIdParam"}],"post":{"description":"Declares whichever of the requested hostnames the tenant does not own yet and runs one ownership check over each of them, so an order covering N names costs one round trip instead of 2N. The hostnames are fully qualified names rather than zone-relative ones: the server folds them back, because every caller that re-derives the fold is a place for the leading \"*.\" to be applied twice.\n","operationId":"domainZones.hostnameClaims.ensure","parameters":[{"$ref":"#/components/parameters/IdempotencyKeyParam"}],"requestBody":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/sc