platform_metrics_summaries` and is restricted to the platform operator tenant.\nEvery figure is an aggregate. No user, tenant, or application is returned, so the reading reports the size of an estate without becoming a second, quieter way to enumerate its subjects.\nThe tenant count is absent here rather than reported at `1`: a tenant counting itself is a constant, and a surface handed one would draw it.\n`date_from` and `date_to` bound the **series** - the per-day trend - and never the four card windows, which stay resolved server-side from the clock. The series window is the caller's because the same window control drives the traffic trend drawn beside it on one chart; the two readings must resolve the same period or their lines would be plotted against a domain their days were not cut against.","operationId":"metricsSummaries.retrieve","parameters":[{"description":"Inclusive UTC calendar day (`YYYY-MM-DD`) the per-day series starts on. Defaults to the trailing 30 days. The card windows ignore it.","in":"query","name":"date_from","schema":{"maxLength":10,"minLength":10,"type":"string"}},{"description":"Exclusive UTC calendar day (`YYYY-MM-DD`) the per-day series ends before. Defaults to tomorrow (UTC). The card windows ignore it.","in":"query","name":"date_to","schema":{"maxLength":10,"minLength":10,"type":"string"}}],"responses":{"200":{"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/SdkWorkApiResponse"},{"properties":{"data":{"properties":{"item":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/MetricsSummaryResponse"}},"required":["item"],"type":"object"}},"required":["data"],"type":"object"}]}}},"description":"Dashboard metric summary returned successfully."}},"security":[{"AccessToken":[],"AuthToken":[]}],"summary":"Retrieve the dashboard metric summary of the caller's own tenant","tags":["metricsSummary"],"x-sdkwork-api-authority":"sdkwork-webserver-backend-api","x-sdkwork-api-surface":"backend-api","x-sdkwork-auth-mode":"dual-token","x-sdkwork-