  ('2b4fc828-9023-552f-87b7-4b28062506e5', 100001, 'faf763a1-e1f1-5448-aeab-844b22643f5d', 'certificates.list', 'GET', '/backend/v3/api/certificates', 'List canonical certificates', $sdkwork_catalog${"en-US":"List canonical certificates"}$sdkwork_catalog$::jsonb, 'Cursor mode over the per-issuance-growing certificate collection. Every page carries `pageInfo.mode: "cursor"` and, when more rows exist, the opaque `nextCursor` the next request must present. The first request (no cursor) also reports the exact `totalItems`; deeper pages omit it. `page` is not part of this operation and is refused.', $sdkwork_catalog${"en-US":"Cursor mode over the per-issuance-growing certificate collection. Every page carries `pageInfo.mode: \"cursor\"` and, when more rows exist, the opaque `nextCursor` the next request must present. The first request (no cursor) also reports the exact `totalItems`; deeper pages omit it. `page` is not part of this operation and is refused."}$sdkwork_catalog$::jsonb, $sdkwork_catalog$["certificate"]$sdkwork_catalog$::jsonb, FALSE, 490),
